D47. A cockney's idea of a devilish place. ~ ELL
D51. An overhead expense. ~ HAT
D53. This one has a head at each end. ~ KEG
D55. The effects of the modern movies. ~ SOUND
D56. This kind of a shirt is the very latest. ~ CLEAN
D57. A kind of lens. ~ TORIC
D58. This is what Greta Garbo reaches for instead of a Lucky. ~ SWEDE
D60. This is what some of the new auto horns carry. ~ TUNE
D61. Tbis took a sudden jump last month. ~ FROG
